# Example only. Not installed.
#
# Runs as any user; no privileges are required. --quiet prints nothing when the
# result is OK, so cron mails you only when something is wrong.
#
# Install with: crontab -e

*/5 * * * * /usr/bin/astral-guard --quiet

# A longer sample window costs a few more seconds and makes a transient even
# less likely to be reported:
#
# */5 * * * * /usr/bin/astral-guard --quiet --samples 10
